  "finding": "Every wording traded the same way: the insufficient_evidence cases it recovered were paid for by conflict cases it lost. hv11-016 and hv11-031 were already marginal on v22, one of two formal runs each, and all three wordings pushed them to stable failure. v23c protected joint deduction explicitly and changed nothing, so the model is not merely missing permission to combine premises. hv11-024 never recovered under any wording although its shape, a measured sample read as the whole set, was stated outright in two of the three.",
  "consequence": "The V11 gate result stands as recorded: failed on insufficient_evidence recall. The defect is carried into the next held-out set as a known limitation rather than papered over, and the next set measures whether it reproduces on cases nobody has seen."
